  38:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  */
  39:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c **** 
  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c **** 
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c **** /**
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * @brief Q15 matrix multiplication (fast variant) for Cortex-M3 and Cortex-M4
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * @param[in]       *pSrcA points to the first input matrix structure
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * @param[in]       *pSrcB points to the second input matrix structure
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * @param[out]      *pDst points to output matrix structure
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * @param[in]       *pState points to the array for storing intermediate results
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * @return          The function returns either
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * <code>ARM_MATH_SIZE_MISMATCH</code> or <code>ARM_MATH_SUCCESS</code> based on the outcome of siz
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  *
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * @details
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  *
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * \par
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * The difference between the function arm_mat_mult_q15() and this fast variant is that
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * the fast variant use a 32-bit rather than a 64-bit accumulator.
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * The result of each 1.15 x 1.15 multiplication is truncated to
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * 2.30 format. These intermediate results are accumulated in a 32-bit register in 2.30
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * format. Finally, the accumulator is saturated and converted to a 1.15 result.
  59:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  *
  60:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * \par
  61:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * The fast version has the same overflow behavior as the standard version but provides
  62:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * less precision since it discards the low 16 bits of each multiplication result.
  63:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * In order to avoid overflows completely the input signals must be scaled down.
  64:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * Scale down one of the input matrices by log2(numColsA) bits to
  65:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * avoid overflows, as a total of numColsA additions are computed internally for each
  66:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * output element.
  67:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  *
  68:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * \par
  69:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * See <code>arm_mat_mult_q15()</code> for a slower implementation of this function
  70:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  * which uses 64-bit accumulation to provide higher precision.
  71:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c ****  */
  72:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/MatrixFunctions/arm_mat_mult_fast_q15.c **** 
